# Project Rules & Blueprint

## App Definition
- We are building a web application using our existing project stack in Omarchy Quattro.

## Rules for Hermes (Background Agent)
- Read this file before beginning work to check the current Roadmap status.
- Always create a new git branch for any major feature request.
- Do not commit directly to the 'main' branch.

## Rules for Cursor (Editor AI)
- Help me review, polish, and debug the code that Hermes generates on its branch.

